Christina invited 16 friends. She needs 0.75 gift bags per invited guest, so the total number of gift bags needed is:

\[
16 \times 0.75 = 12 \text{ gift bags}
\]

Each gift bag costs $2, so the total cost is:

\[
12 \times 2 = 24 \text{ dollars}
\]

\boxed{24}

